{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Red Machina is a virtual system created to cater to the darkest desires of players. X, the last player to access it, finds himself in the midst of a plot of corruption, betrayal, and collapse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo features the <strong>Hospital</strong> map, a glimpse into the narrative experience of <i>RED MACHINA</i>.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Here, your <strong>moral and ethical</strong> choices shape the fate of the patients and lead to different endings, highlighting the game's <strong>dynamic decision-making system</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Amidst the spread of a <strong>deadly virus</strong>, you must treat the patients of wings <strong>A, B, and C</strong>, ensuring their care and trying to prevent more deaths \u2014 even when <strong>resources and medications are not enough for everyone</strong>.</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Resident Evil 1, Silent Hill, and Cosmology of Kyoto are the main inspirations for the visuals and atmosphere of Red Machina. </p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Authentic PSX-style audio;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Vertex-based lighting;</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Textures faithful to the limitations of the original PlayStation era;</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average duration: 30 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>gameplay</strong>, <strong>concept</strong>, and <strong>immersion</strong> of RED MACHINA in this demo.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4003580?t=1761842814","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003580/fcfba5f965c6f1655484250016a289e540113922/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761842814","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/s