he limitations of the original PlayStation era;</p></li></ul></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Average duration: 30 minutes.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience the <strong>gameplay</strong>, <strong>concept</strong>, and <strong>immersion</strong> of RED MACHINA in this demo.</p>","developers":["Dante Esposato"],"fullgame":{"appid":"1379880","name":"RED MACHINA"},"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4003580/6accba94595b554d401ac44c8ad77c937b46287d/header.jpg?t=1761842814","is_free":true,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003580/1684531672/ceb981a20b7e062de63e5c1d68ae839383f44882/1761086082/dash_av1.mpd?t=1761678035","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003580/1684531672/ceb981a20b7e062de63e5c1d68ae839383f44882/1761086082/dash_h264.mpd?t=1761678035","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/4003580/1684531672/ceb981a20b7e062de63e5c1d68ae839383f44882/1761086082/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1761678035","id":257218343,"mp4":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218343/movie480.mp4?t=1761678035","max":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218343/movie_max.mp4?t=1761678035"},"name":"RED MACHINA: Revalisco Demo Trailer 1","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257218343/b6dca479d27d5ccca12a101a697504e91b5e3451/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1761678035","webm":{"480":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257218343/movie480.webm?t=1761